stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE
  IDLE --> BASELINE_RECORDING: 开始记录基准
  BASELINE_RECORDING --> IDLE: 停车后结束并保存
  IDLE --> ARMED: 进入准备
  ARMED --> START_CANDIDATE: 接近 A
  START_CANDIDATE --> ARMED: 候选失败
  START_CANDIDATE --> SECTOR_1: A 确认
  SECTOR_1 --> SECTOR_2: S1 确认
  SECTOR_2 --> SECTOR_3: S2 确认
  SECTOR_3 --> FINISH_CANDIDATE: 接近 B
  FINISH_CANDIDATE --> SECTOR_3: 候选失败
  FINISH_CANDIDATE --> COMPLETED: B 确认
  ARMED --> CANCELLED: 用户结束
  SECTOR_1 --> CANCELLED: 用户结束
  SECTOR_2 --> CANCELLED: 用户结束
  SECTOR_3 --> CANCELLED: 用户结束
  BASELINE_RECORDING --> INTERRUPTED: 服务/进程/重启
  ARMED --> INTERRUPTED: 服务/进程/重启
  SECTOR_1 --> INTERRUPTED: 服务/进程/重启
  SECTOR_2 --> INTERRUPTED: 服务/进程/重启
  SECTOR_3 --> INTERRUPTED: 服务/进程/重启
  COMPLETED --> IDLE
  CANCELLED --> IDLE
  INTERRUPTED --> IDLE

